// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - CleanUp 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3043814858" "<color deepskyblue>JANE HALLAWAY TASK FORCE:  'Terror Volta' <br>Part: One<br><br></color>I've been hearing some strange rumors about the Sky Raiders lately.  Word on the street is that they're closing in on some big goal.  Don't spread this around, but I'm hoping you and some of your hero friends can assist me in my investigation.  There's something huge going on here, and I'm determined to find out what."
// AcceptString :
"P869879846" "Assist in Ms. HALLAWAY's investigation."
// SendOffString :
"P3629834092" "<color deepskyblue>JANE HALLAWAY TASK FORCE:  'Terror Volta' <br>Part: One<br><br></color>My investigations into the Sky Raiders have taken an ugly turn of late. You should probably begin by talking to one of my informants, Jason Serano. He's sort of a shady character, but he keeps me up to my ears in tips on the Sky Raiders."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - CleanUp_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2451303813" "Speak to Jason Serano"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P175105963" "<color deepskyblue>JANE HALLAWAY TASK FORCE:  'Terror Volta' <br>Part: One<br><br></color>Go talk to Jason.  He should be able to give you more details about recent Sky Raider activity."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3303492763" "Normally I wouldn't talk to anyone off the street, but if Jane says you're okay, I guess that'll do. <br><br>Here's the scoop. The Sky Raiders are looking for a job to take on, some sort of mercenary work to help finance their operations. Trouble is, they're going through very secret channels, and I haven't been able to contact them. Know what I'd suggest? Take to the streets. If you hit them hard and hit them fast, they just might come looking for you. <br><br>We don't know much about their activities right now, but it's your job to make sure they don't know that. If they think we're already onto their latest plot, there's a good chance they'll let something slip."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - CleanUp_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P278649034" "Get Sky Raiders' attention"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2193601545" "<color deepskyblue>JANE HALLAWAY TASK FORCE:  'Terror Volta' <br>Part: One<br><br></color>I need you to get out there and kick some Sky Raider tail. We need to know what they're up to, and right now I'm fresh out of leads."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3059299610" "On one of the Sky Raiders you defeated, you found a tattered business card."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2172694876" "<color deepskyblue>JANE HALLAWAY TASK FORCE:  'Terror Volta' <br>Part: One<br><br></color>So Jason sent you after the Sky Raiders, huh?  That's just like him; his motto is, 'Muscle always gets the job done.' I have to admit, you sure got results. <br><br>I'm sure this business card for Lofty Connections must mean something. I wouldn't be at all surprised to find out it's a front company for the Sky Raiders."
// RandomFameString :
"P2090473715" "Did you hear about that new company, Lofty Connections?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P856364347" ""
// RandomFameString :
"P2741219342" "I hear the Sky Raiders have been taking a beating from some group calling themselves {TaskForceName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - OfficeFront 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P434026048" "<color deepskyblue>JANE HALLAWAY TASK FORCE:  'Terror Volta' <br>Part: Two<br><br></color>You may think that a business card found on a defeated Sky Raider isn't much of a lead, but let me tell you, I've built prize-winning stories out of less.  <color orange>The first step is to check out this business, Lofty Connections</color>.  See if it's legit. If you find anything there to confirm the business' connection to the Sky Raiders, we'll be off and running."
// AcceptString :
"P3607632846" "Check out Lofty Connections"
// SendOffString :
"P1820358154" "<color deepskyblue>JANE HALLAWAY TASK FORCE:  'Terror Volta' <br>Part: Two<br><br></color>I'm determined to keep digging until we get to the bottom of the Sky Raiders' latest plot."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P94542441" "Defeat Sgt. Clayton & his men"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2420472240" "<color deepskyblue>JANE HALLAWAY TASK FORCE:  'Terror Volta' <br>Part: Two<br><br></color>I need you to head over to Lofty Connections and see if you can tie that business to the Sky Raiders."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
