// Dialog :
"P4058628142" "<color deepskyblue>JANE HALLAWAY TASK FORCE:  'Terror Volta' <br>Part: Two<br><br></color>Asbestos suits? Containment equipment? Based on this, I'd say that Sky Raider who taunted you was playing it straight. I can hardly believe it, but the Sky Raiders actually intend to attack the Terra Volta reactor! {TaskForceName}, you are going to have to move fast!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - ReactorCore 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2986729366" "<color deepskyblue>JANE HALLAWAY TASK FORCE:  'Terror Volta' <br>Part: Finale<br><br></color>This is big, {TaskForceName}. The Terra Volta reactor is in jeopardy. Unless I miss my guess, the Sky Raiders intend to drain the reactor core of its fuel, leaving the rest of Paragon City in the dark. The Sky Raiders may plan to sell that fuel on the black market, or, even worse, they may plan to build a dirty bomb! Either way, Paragon City can't make it without the reactor running.  <br><br><color orange>You've got to stop the Sky Raiders!</color> Stop them at once!"
// AcceptString :
"P3405373490" "Save the Terra Volta reactor"
// SendOffString :
"P3871013537" "<color deepskyblue>JANE HALLAWAY TASK FORCE:  'Terror Volta' <br>Part: Finale<br><br></color>Ever since the Rikti War, the reactor's been this city's primary source of power. Without it, we can say goodbye to light bulbs, heating, and refrigerated food."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P247627655" "Save Terra Volta reactor"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3733415437" "<color deepskyblue>JANE HALLAWAY TASK FORCE:  'Terror Volta' <br>Part: Finale<br><br></color>Get over to the reactor in Terra Volta!  Protect it all costs!"

