// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1052899250" "<color deepskyblue>JANE HALLAWAY TASK FORCE:  'Terror Volta' <br>Part: Finale<br><br></color>Well, luckily Freedom Corps was able to finish off the Sky Raiders' assault team before the reactor was destroyed. They even managed to recover all the core material the Sky Raiders planned to make off with. <br><br>Still, I wouldn't be surprised to see those mercenaries try something like this again. I'll keep my ear to the ground; I hope you'll check back with me soon."
// RandomFameString :
"P3218197982" "The Freedom Corps saved the Terra Volta reactor!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1475297222" "<color deepskyblue>JANE HALLAWAY TASK FORCE:  'Terror Volta' <br>Part: Finale<br><br></color>You've done it, {TaskForceName}! You've saved the Terra Volta reactor!  To tell you the truth, I'm a little shaken by the depths of the Sky Raiders' villainy. <br><br>I hope you'll check back with me from time to time.  It could well be that they'll try something like this again. <br><br>You know, I hate to tell you this, but you're looking a little strange. I've heard stories before about people who got too close to the Terra Volta reactor experiencing strange side effects. You should drop by City Hall in Atlas Park and see a friend of mine, Jack Wolfe. He's an expert on the effects of radiation; he can tell you exactly what's up."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// RandomFameString :
"P3689765535" "{TaskForceName} saved the Terra Volta reactor!"
